{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "03O6", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$N$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$N$", "MATH_0005": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0006": "$\\varphi : N \\otimes_A B \\cong B \\otimes_A N$", "MATH_0007": "$B \\otimes_A B$", "MATH_0008": "$B \\otimes_A B \\otimes_A B$", "MATH_0009": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n{N \\otimes_A B \\otimes_A B} \\ar[dr]_{\\varphi_{02}} \\ar[rr]^{\\varphi_{01}} & &\n{B \\otimes_A N \\otimes_A B} \\ar[dl]^{\\varphi_{12}} \\\\\n& {B \\otimes_A B \\otimes_A N}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$\\varphi_{01} = \\varphi \\otimes \\text{id}_B$", "MATH_0011": "$\\varphi_{12}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\varphi_{02}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-descent-datum-modules}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:04513b415a1d9eca5ac59a7023d83e3c845e13d3bd1a3f540e4c150635a1b133", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ad09e4eb64f6b6591c37b0a58bf83c90987382b8c806ad407a8c33494cd67f6f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ring map and <MATH_0002> a <MATH_0003>-module. A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>descent datum<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> for\n<MATH_0004> with respect to <MATH_0005> is an isomorphism\n<MATH_0006> of <MATH_0007>-modules such\nthat the diagram of <MATH_0008>-modules\n<MATH_0009>\ncommutes where <MATH_0010> and similarly\nfor <MATH_0011> and <MATH_0012>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:56dbf637f0599757b3b8872bb0d2f77e0e7d5d1c1bdec238870bfadf360d9123", "unit_id": "tag:03OB:statement"}
